Some UnNetHack user found a smallish bug that also exists in Vanilla.

First clean a level of all items, then go into a vault and wait for
the vault guard to appear.

Kill the vault guard and then quaff a potion of object detection.

You will get the message "You sense the presence of objects" even
though none are shown and also the guard's inventory cannot be found
anywhere by digging.

I don't know yet what is causing this behavior.

